cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this table, please cite the version you used."
type: dataset
title: "Open CMT Gene Table"
abstract: >-
  Genes linked to Charcot-Marie-Tooth disease (CMT) and related inherited
  neuropathies, one row per ClinGen gene-disease curation, with the subtype
  names that go with each rating, inheritance, GeneReviews and PanelApp links,
  registered drug trials and a plain-language note. Every hand-checked value
  carries a source URL.
authors:
